@startuml delegate-best-practice
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #94a3b8
skinparam componentBorderColor #3b82f6

title Delegate 多环境部署最佳实践

rectangle "生产环境 VPC" as prod {
    component "Delegate-Prod-1 (Replica 1)" as d_prod_1
    component "Delegate-Prod-2 (Replica 2)" as d_prod_2
    note bottom: Selector: prod\n高可用双副本
}

rectangle "预发布环境 VPC" as staging {
    component "Delegate-Staging (Replica 1)" as d_staging
    note bottom: Selector: staging\n单副本即可
}

rectangle "开发测试环境 VPC" as dev {
    component "Delegate-Dev (Replica 1)" as d_dev
    note bottom: Selector: dev\n共享使用
}

rectangle "Harness SaaS" as harness {
    component "Pipeline Engine + 任务调度器" as scheduler
}

scheduler --> d_prod_1 : Selector=prod 任务
scheduler --> d_prod_2 : Selector=prod 任务（负载均衡）
scheduler --> d_staging : Selector=staging 任务
scheduler --> d_dev : Selector=dev 任务

note right of prod
  最佳实践：
  • 生产环境独立 Delegate
  • 不与其他环境共享
  • minimal 镜像 + 自定义工具
  • 定期轮换 Delegate Token
end note

@enduml
